WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.880
If you take injectable GLP-1 medications or other weight loss drugs such as

2
00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:07.920
phentermine, there's an important step to be aware of before your procedure.

3
00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:13.720
These medications slow digestion, which can affect how your stomach empties and may interfere with your prep.

4
00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:18.480
For that reason, your care team may ask you to hold your GLP-1 before your colonoscopy.

5
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:22.320
Typically, you will need to hold your dose for one week, but if you are not sure,

6
00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:26.440
please call your doctor's office to confirm exactly when to take your last dose.

7
00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:30.440
Do not stop or adjust any medication without speaking with them first.

8
00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:33.760
We just want to make sure everything goes smoothly on procedure day.
